{"id": "MINIGAME/JT19YURI.SBN#0001", "file": "MINIGAME/JT19YURI.SBN", "offset": 3369, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "25743130", "baseline_text": "%t10", "kind": "ascr", "source": "%t10", "pointer_offset": 3188, "unit": "dialogue:a00cbea9173d423c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT19YURI.SBN#0002", "file": "MINIGAME/JT19YURI.SBN", "offset": 3374, "capacity": 16, "raw_hex": "f0a4f8a4f287f8c8f1c8f0b8f26181b8", "baseline_text": "지지 않을 거니까∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "負けないからね！", "pointer_offset": 3192, "unit": "dialogue:26fff60187dc84ce", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT19YURI.SBN#0003", "file": "MINIGAME/JT19YURI.SBN", "offset": 4030, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f0b2fa48f0bcf0d7f0b9f147f15781432f2ff99cf64cf1442f2ff1acf25af8aaf64cf944f243f95af154f0cff1688144", "baseline_text": "이번 시합에서는，//내 패가//보너스 패가 되어 있다구．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "この試合では、//あたしのパイが//ボーナスパイになってるのよ。", "pointer_offset": 3196, "unit": "dialogue:f32cfe3953fef222", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT19YURI.SBN#0004", "file": "MINIGAME/JT19YURI.SBN", "offset": 3452, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f0b2fa48f1e2f0dff957f0b2f1c8f14881442f2ff8b2f140f0b9f1478143f15af8bdf9a9f1d5f0d2f0e72f2ff1e1f3c1f2658144", "baseline_text": "이번 주제는 이거야．//이 중에서，어느 한 세트를//맞춰줘．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今回のお題はこれ。//この中の、どれか１組を//そろえてね。", "pointer_offset": 3200, "unit": "dialogue:f3783b72b226740c", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT19YURI.SBN#0005", "file": "MINIGAME/JT19YURI.SBN", "offset": 4079, "capacity": 24, "raw_hex": "f0b2f248f0b9f15781432f2ff19cf944f5f3f0c7f1488144", "baseline_text": "이번에는，//내가 딜러야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今度は、//あたしが親よ。", "pointer_offset": 3204, "unit": "dialogue:d39945a6d3174ce7", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT19YURI.SBN#0006", "file": "MINIGAME/JT19YURI.SBN", "offset": 3995, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f0b2f248f0b9f15781432f2ff0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f944f5f3f0c7f0a8f0b8f7d1", "baseline_text": "이번에는，//오오가미 씨가 딜러라니…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今度は、//大神さんが親か……", "pointer_offset": 3208, "unit": "dialogue:18b611d695f2ff26", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT19YURI.SBN#0007", "file": "MINIGAME/JT19YURI.SBN", "offset": 3563, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f18ef1acf0e2f0a3f0f0f0ef81b82f2ff0aff374f8f3f99cf26af0e2f1442f2ffa81f243f29ef15af0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "정보대로네요∈//아직은 내 상대가//못 되겠어요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "情報どおり∈//まだまだあたしの敵じゃ//ないですね！", "pointer_offset": 3212, "unit": "dialogue:d18f8c9a50177df4", "prior_review": "말투 점검"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT19YURI.SBN#0008", "file": "MINIGAME/JT19YURI.SBN", "offset": 3614, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f18ef263f7d1f25af96bf2ddf14bf0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "정말…너무 강해요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "もう……強すぎっ∈", "pointer_offset": 3216, "unit": "dialogue:4a52622dab8aa9ca", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT19YURI.SBN#0009", "file": "MINIGAME/JT19YURI.SBN", "offset": 3633, "capacity": 24, "raw_hex": "f14ef17bf5bbf0f32f2ffb49f2e6f0a8f0b8f261f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "조금쯤은//봐 달라니까요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "すこしぐらい、//てかげんしてよね！", "pointer_offset": 3220, "unit": "dialogue:0caa5d89da18ad4c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT19YURI.SBN#0010", "file": "MINIGAME/JT19YURI.SBN", "offset": 3668, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f0b2f248f0b9f1572f2ff16bf2d5f293f8d3f258f0d3f144f0ef8148", "baseline_text": "이번에는//무승부인 셈인가요？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今回は//痛み分けってところかしら？", "pointer_offset": 3224, "unit": "dialogue:38f0250bf495c333", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT19YURI.SBN#0011", "file": "MINIGAME/JT19YURI.SBN", "offset": 3703, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f2b5f25af2a9f0d2f944f3a1f259f8c8f16e", "baseline_text": "토너먼트가 끝났을 때", "kind": "ascr", "source": "勝ち抜き戦が終わった時", "pointer_offset": 3228, "unit": "dialogue:bb0e5833a13689be", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT19YURI.SBN#0012", "file": "MINIGAME/JT19YURI.SBN", "offset": 3726, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f491f0a5f186f469f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "축하드립니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "おめでとうございます。", "pointer_offset": 3232, "unit": "dialogue:b84710c5e1d20d4f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
